WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:06.539
&gt;&gt; WELL EARLIER TODAY, THE HEAD
OF THE WAGNER GROUP, YEVGENY

00:00:06.539 --> 00:00:13.446
PRIGOZHIN CLAIMED THAT THE
ENTIRE AREA AROUND SOLEDAR IS

00:00:13.446 --> 00:00:17.417
UNDER RUSSIAN CONTROL.
UKRAINE DENIES THIS, AND THE

00:00:17.417 --> 00:00:21.688
KREMLIN WILL ONLY SAY THAT
THERE IS A POSITIVE TREND IN

00:00:21.688 --> 00:00:27.527
THE FIGHTING.
MY NEXT GUEST TWEETED ABOUT A

00:00:27.527 --> 00:00:32.332
PROPOSAL BY A REPORTER FROM
RUSSIAN STATE MEDIA THAT, QUOTE,

00:00:32.332 --> 00:00:40.039
YEVGENY PROVISION IT WILL BE
PROMOTED TO MAJOR GENERAL.

00:00:40.039 --> 00:00:46.379
THESE SOLEDAR OFFENSIVE WILL
BOLSTER HIS STANDING IN RUSSIAN

00:00:46.379 --> 00:00:49.449
POLITICS.
SAMUEL RAHMANI JOINS ME NOW

00:00:49.449 --> 00:00:54.320
FROM OXFORD IN ENGLAND.
CAN YOU JUST EXPLAIN FOR OUR

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:59.492
VIEWERS, WHO THE WAGNER GROUP
IS FIRST AND FOREMOST?

00:00:59.492 --> 00:01:06.232
AND WHO IT IS WHO RUNS IT.
&gt;&gt; SO THE WAGNER GROUP IS

00:01:06.232 --> 00:01:12.138
NOMINALLY A PRIVATE COMPANY.
THAT IS ILLEGAL UNDER RUSSIAN

00:01:12.138 --> 00:01:14.440
LAW.
IT IS CLOSELY ALIGNED WITH THE

00:01:14.440 --> 00:01:20.180
MAIN INTELLIGENCE DIRECTORATE.
THE HEAD OF THE WAGNER GROUP'S

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:27.186
YEVGENY PRIGOZHIN.
&gt;&gt; WHAT DOES THE KREMLIN GAIN

00:01:27.186 --> 00:01:33.893
FROM HAVING HIM AND THE WAGNER
GROUP WORKING FOR THEM,

00:01:33.893 --> 00:01:38.898
EFFECTIVELY?
AND WHAT DO THEY GAIN FROM

00:01:38.898 --> 00:01:43.036
WAGNER MERCENARY ACTIVITIES ON
THE GROUND IN UKRAINE?

00:01:43.036 --> 00:01:44.103
LET'S BE QUITE CLEAR ABOUT
THIS.

00:01:44.103 --> 00:01:51.578
&gt;&gt; WELL, THE WAGNER GROUP,
FIRST OF ALL, ADDS MAN COUNT OF

00:01:51.578 --> 00:01:55.248
RUSSIAN MILITARY.
40,000 CONSCRIPTS FROM THE

00:01:55.248 --> 00:01:56.849
PRISONS, BEFORE THAT MAJOR
MOBILIZATION.

00:01:56.849 --> 00:02:07.893
ALSO, THEY ARE TRAINED AND HAVE
EXPERIENCE.

00:02:07.893 --> 00:02:19.505
ALSO THE WAGNER GROUP IS ADEPT
AT SEIZING CONTROL OF MINERAL

00:02:19.505 --> 00:02:22.742
ASSETS IN THESE INFORMATION
CAMPAIGNS.

00:02:22.742 --> 00:02:34.920
THEY HAVE CONTROL OF THIS TOWN,
WHICH IS VERY CLOSE TO BAKHMUT.

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:38.958
WE'VE BEEN EXPLAINING WHY THAT
IS SIGNIFICANT.

00:02:38.958 --> 00:02:43.730
WHAT I DID THINK WAS IMPORTANT
WAS THAT YESTERDAY, THEY

00:02:43.730 --> 00:02:46.132
SUGGESTED THAT THE UKRAINIANS
HAVE BEEN FIGHTING WITH HONOR.

00:02:46.132 --> 00:02:50.737
IT DID SEEM ODD, COMING FROM A
MAN WHOSE REPUTATION STANDS

00:02:50.737 --> 00:02:53.906
BEFORE HIM, AS IT WERE.
WAGNER'S AMBITIONS HAVE NOT

00:02:53.906 --> 00:02:56.276
GONE UNNOTICED IN WASHINGTON
D.C..

00:02:56.276 --> 00:03:00.513
TAKE A LISTEN TO WHAT THE
SECRETARY OF DEFENSE SAID AT A

00:03:00.513 --> 00:03:05.952
BRIEFING A FEW DAYS AGO.
&gt;&gt; IN THE RECENT PAST, WE'VE

00:03:05.952 --> 00:03:11.858
SEEN THAT WAGNER IS ADVANCING
AND A MORE RAPID CLIP THAT ANY

00:03:11.858 --> 00:03:14.026
OTHER UNIT IN THE RUSSIAN
MILITARY.

00:03:14.026 --> 00:03:20.166
&gt;&gt; CRACK STARTING TO EMERGE IN
WAGNER'S RELATIONSHIP,

00:03:20.166 --> 00:03:24.404
CERTAINLY WITH THE OTHER
RUSSIAN MILITARY.

00:03:24.404 --> 00:03:27.740
ARE WE SEEING CRACKS WITH THE
KREMLIN?

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:30.310
PARTICULARLY THE RUSSIAN
DEFENSE MINISTER SHOW A GO.

00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:34.213
AND IF SO, WHAT COMES NEXT?
WHAT'S THE END GOAL HERE FOR

00:03:34.213 --> 00:03:39.218
WAGNER?
&gt;&gt; SO YEVGENY PRIGOZHIN HAS HAD

00:03:39.218 --> 00:03:41.287
A LONG-STANDING NEGATIVE
RELATIONSHIP WITH --

00:03:41.287 --> 00:03:44.423
IT DATES BACK TO THE CAMPAIGN
IN SYRIA WHEN THE WAGNER GROUP

00:03:44.423 --> 00:03:50.263
WAS OFTEN DIRECTLY BEING HIRED
BY THE RUSSIAN DEFENSE MINISTRY,

00:03:50.263 --> 00:04:00.239
TO CARRY OUT OPERATIONS.
AND NOW, WITH YEVGENY PRIGOZHIN

00:04:00.239 --> 00:04:04.210
TAKING ADVANTAGE OF HOW THIS
WAR IS BEING PROSECUTED, HAS HE

00:04:04.210 --> 00:04:05.812
USED TELEGRAM CHANNELS TO SMEAR
--

00:04:05.812 --> 00:04:09.282
SO IT APPEARS AS IF YEVGENY
PRIGOZHIN IT'S TRYING TO

00:04:09.282 --> 00:04:12.185
POSITION SELF AS A SHADOW
DEFENSE MINISTER OF SORTS, WHO

00:04:12.185 --> 00:04:15.388
IS MORE RESPECTED THAN --
AND ALSO WHO HAS PUTIN'S EAR.

00:04:15.388 --> 00:04:19.425
SO I THINK THAT THIS IS
SIGNIFICANT REALIGNMENT OF

00:04:19.425 --> 00:04:23.196
RUSSIAN ELITE POLITICS, THAT
COULD MAKE RUSSIA EVEN MORE

00:04:23.196 --> 00:04:26.366
UNPREDICTABLE AND DANGEROUS,
AND MORE RESISTANT TO DIPLOMACY

00:04:26.366 --> 00:04:31.170
AND COOPERATION.
&gt;&gt; IT'S GOOD TO GET YOUR

00:04:31.170 --> 00:04:33.539
ANALYSIS, IT'S AN IMPORTANT
STORY.

00:04:33.539 --> 00:04:35.341
EXTREMELY IMPORTANT STORY, ON
THE GROUND.

00:04:35.341 --> 00:04:39.245
WE ARE TEN AND A HALF MONTHS
INTO THIS CONFLICT, AND WE HAVE

00:04:39.245 --> 00:04:44.317
SEEN SOME OF THE MOST BRUTAL
TRENCH WARFARE AROUND SOLEDAR

00:04:44.317 --> 00:04:46.319
AS THAT BATTLE CONTINUES.
IT'S IMPORTANT THAT WE GET THE

00:04:46.319 --> 00:04:48.621
CONTEXT FROM THAT BATTLE FOR SO
WHAT ARE.

00:04:48.621 --> 00:04:53.159
THANK YOU FOR PUTTING A
SPOTLIGHT ON THE WAGNER GROUP,

00:04:53.159 --> 00:04:57.330
AND CNN TAKES A LOOK AT THE
CONTROVERSIAL LEADER.

00:04:57.330 --> 00:05:02.468
FIND OUT WHY HE IS CALLED
PUTIN'S CHEF, AND WHY HE'S USED

00:05:02.468 --> 00:05:06.372
THE WAR IN UKRAINE TO RAISE
WAGNER'S PROFILE.

